<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-MMI half year profit improves.</title>
<headline>RTRS-MMI half year profit improves.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		     (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    23.02 vs 19.19</p>
<p>    Net				     18.08 vs 15.11</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    10.0  vs 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: MMI Ltd is an insurance firm 38 percent owned by Germany's Allianz AG.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  421.89 vs 397.38</p>
<p>    Other income			 322.09 vs 251.21</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   14.94 vs 13.48</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 21</p>
<p>Reg date March 7</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					4.94 vs 4.09</p>
<p>    Interest				 2.17 vs 3.90</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   5.12 vs 5.07</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
